  "limitations": [
    "All OpenAI, Anthropic, Codex and Claude Code adapters are deterministic synthetic fixture ports only. No SDK, real endpoint, credential, login, provider request or provider activation exists.",
    "Subscription routes resolve the canonical frozen CLI templates, which remain NOT_CONFIGURED with activationAllowed=false; no process is spawned and no ambient API or subscription credential is read.",
    "Paid API and owner subscription CLI are separate capability and credential classes. Mismatch, stale output, unavailable route and credential-source drift fail closed with fallbackUsed=false.",
    "The shipped tool registry remains disabled. Synthetic execution requires an externally admitted test-mode registry projection and grants no authority.",
    "Search and repository inspection return closed frozen canned evidence only. No browser, fetch, filesystem read, filesystem mutation or patch application occurs.",
    "Sandboxed patch proposal support is a thin non-executing projection of the existing planIsolatedPatchWorker owner. It creates no worktree, runs no tests, applies no patch, creates no commit and never falls back unsandboxed.",
    "The ordered base 098f7b9 is not an ancestor of the sealed A3 or this implementation. D-LAUNCH-37 explicitly required the sealed A3 extension in the same worktree; the receipt does not claim otherwise.",
    "No package root, shared schema, router, startup file, money path, STATE.md, Main, role4-fix, candidate or other worktree was touched.",
    "Full, browser, performance and soak suites were not run because the active fix owner owns heavy same-machine suites. No broader green claim is made.",
    "C2 verification and director adjudication remain mandatory before any possible porting or acceptance."
